# Local Claude Code state
# .claude's CONTENTS are ignored, not the directory itself: git cannot re-include
# a file whose parent directory is excluded, and the agent config below has to be
# committed because a cloud session only ever sees committed files.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/cloud-setup.sh
!.claude/session-start.sh
